hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1789","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baithey they aur Aap par Surat-ul-Jumuah naazil hui: (Aur un mein se doosrey jo abhi un se nahi milay). Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo kaun hain Ya Rasulullah? To Aap ne use jawaab na diya yahan tak ke teen martaba poochha. Jabke ham mein Salmaan Faarsi they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna haath Salmaan par rakkha, phir farmaya: Agar imaan Surayya key paas hota to use un mein se aadmi ya aik aadmi paa leta. (Bukhari: 4897). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Jab munaafiq tumharey paas aaein aur kahein ke ham gawahi detey hain ke tum Allah key Rasool ho)."
